{"w":["2026-10-26","2026-11-01"],"built":"2026-10-26T21:05Z","pending":106,"N":["","Jed's FAQ: \"Yes, Jed's coffee is by nature suitable for vegetarians and vegans.\" No dairy ingredients added.","Blue Frog's product page for the porridge pockets says \"100% vegan\".","Forty Thieves FAQ: \"all of our nut butter products are 100% plant-based / vegan and dairy-free.\"","The Woolworths NZ pack claim says \"Vegan friendly\"; ingredients list no animal products.","Remedy: \"Kombucha, Sodaly and Switchel are all vegan-friendly.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim: \"Vegan; USDA Organic\"; the coconut milk is plant milk.","Chelsea FAQ: nearly all its sugars and syrups suit vegans; the only exception is Honey Maple Flavoured Syrup.","Vitasoy's Almond Milky product page states \"Suitable for vegetarians and vegans.\"","Bluebird's NZ FAQ (maker of Copper Kettle) lists Copper Kettle Sea Salt as suitable for vegans.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ lists Bluebird Ready Salted (Originals, Thick Cut and Thinly Cut) as suitable for vegans.","PAK'nSAVE describes these peeled edamame as a protein option for vegetarians, vegans and pescatarians; maker lists soybeans and salt only.","Pepsi Max official FAQ: \"Yes, Pepsi MAX is suitable for both vegetarians and vegans.\"","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Feijoa 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Ginger & Turmeric 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","Good Juju FAQ: \"Good Juju is both vegan and gluten-free\"; brand-wide statement from the NZ maker.","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids.","PETA Australia's Accidentally Vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids under Lollies and Chocolate, with no flavour caveat.","Ceres Organics' product page lists the bar as \"Vegetarian, Vegan, Plant Based\" with a Vegan badge.","Mingle's product page shows a \"Vegan Friendly\" badge.","Mingle's product page shows a \"Vegan Friendly\" badge; ingredients are spices and salt.","Remedy: \"Remedy Digestion and Remedy Energy Shots are also vegan-friendly.\"","PETA Australia lists Pringles Original as accidentally vegan, but Pringles makes no vegan claim and its Original Minis list emulsifier 471; check first.","Pringles AU's Hot & Spicy 53g product page states \"Suitable for vegetarians and vegans\".","PAK'nSAVE labels it Vegan, but the maker lists flavour enhancer 635 and unspecified flavours with no vegan claim; check first.","PETA Australia's Accidentally Vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids brand-wide; listed ingredients contain no animal products."],"S":["Woolworths label","Jed's (manufacturer)","Blue Frog (manufacturer)","Forty Thieves (manufacturer)","Woolworths NZ listing (pack claim)","Remedy (manufacturer)","Chelsea (manufacturer)","Vitasoy (manufacturer)","Bluebird (manufacturer)","PAK'nSAVE","Pepsi Max (manufacturer)","Lo Bros (manufacturer)","Good Juju (manufacturer)","PETA Australia","Ceres Organics (manufacturer)","Mingle (manufacturer)","Pringles (manufacturer)"],"U":["","https://www.jedscoffee.co.nz/contact/","https://bluefrogbreakfast.co.nz/products/vanilla-bean-chia-seed-porridge-copy-1","https://www.fortythieves.co.nz/faqs/","https://www.remedydrinks.com/blogs/news/are-remedy-drinks-vegan","https://www.chelsea.co.nz/about-sugar/faqs/","https://soy.com.au/product/almond-milky/","https://www.bluebird.co.nz/faqs","https://www.paknsave.co.nz/shop/product/5042072_ea_000pns","https://www.pepsimax.com.au/faq","https://lobros.co/pages/got-questions","https://www.goodjujusoda.com/pages/faqs","https://www.peta.org.au/living/accidentally-vegan/","https://ceres.co.nz/products/12925-cacao-fig-orange-raw-wholefood-bar-50g","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/taco-mexican-fiesta","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/satay-stir-fry","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/japanese-curry","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/green-curry","https://peta.org.au/living/accidentally-vegan/","https://www.pringles.com/au/product